{12}{Why what happened ? }{}{1}{}{13}{}
{13}{I .. I grew old and he did not find me beautiful any more. You see he did not love me . He only loved my beaty .When the first sings of old age appeared he left me. He he was only seeking for perfection.}{I .. I grew old and he did not find me beautiful any more. You see he did not love me . He only loved my beaty .When the first sings of old age appeared he left me. He he was only seeking for perfection.}{}{}{}{}
