{23}{What went wrong ? }{}{1}{}{24}{}
{24}{Well i am not sure I do not know for sure .But it had something to do with nature restoring the balance. My exxesive study of magick and my ritual broke the natural tech-magick balance and nature respondined with the only way she knew. She restored the balance by tyrning me into a machine.}{Well i am not sure I do not know for sure .But it had something to do with nature restoring the balance. My exxesive study of magick and my ritual broke the natural tech-magick balance and nature respondined with the only way she knew. She restored the balance by tyrning me into a machine.}{}{}{}{}
